## 📐 Spacing Scale

| Var | Size | Usage |
|-----|------|-------|
| xs | 0.5rem | Small gaps |
| sm | 1rem | Default spacing |
| md | 1.5rem | Section padding |
| lg | 2rem | Large padding |
| xl | 3rem | Container gaps |
| 2xl | 4rem | Major sections |
| 3xl | 6rem | Page sections |

Example: `className="px-6 py-12"` = padding 12px (sm) / 24px (lg)

