## 🎯 Common Tasks

### Add a New Section to a Page
1. Create component in appropriate folder: `components/section-name/SectionName.tsx`
2. Import it in the page: `import Section from '@/components/section-name/Section'`
3. Add to JSX: `<Section />`
4. Style with Tailwind classes following the design system

### Add Navigation Link
1. Update `navLinks` array in `components/Navigation.tsx`
2. Create new route folder: `app/your-route/page.tsx`
3. Create page component
4. Add footer link in `components/Footer.tsx`

### Update Styling Globally
1. Edit `app/globals.css` for CSS variables
2. Edit `tailwind.config.ts` for Tailwind extensions
3. Rebuild: `npm run dev`

### Add Images
1. Place in `public/` folder
2. Import: `import { Image } from 'next/image'`
3. Use: `<Image src="/path/image.jpg" alt="desc" width={400} height={300} />`

